WEBVTT

01:24.960 --> 01:27.120
ADAPTED FROM THE LEGEND
OF KUNSHAN JADE BY TAN TIANYIN

01:33.920 --> 01:36.280
I'm embarrassed today.

01:38.320 --> 01:39.680
At the banquet,

01:39.760 --> 01:41.200
the Emperor favored you

01:41.280 --> 01:42.360
and gave you a few drinks,

01:43.120 --> 01:45.240
but you couldn't drink much.

01:45.320 --> 01:46.760
You should have refused His Majesty.

01:46.840 --> 01:48.440
You could refuse.

01:48.520 --> 01:49.560
Alcohol is not good for your health.

01:50.400 --> 01:51.280
Don't drink too much.

01:51.360 --> 01:52.840
I'll keep that in mind.

01:53.360 --> 01:56.720
Here's some tea. Drink it.

01:56.800 --> 01:57.800
Thank you.

02:01.280 --> 02:02.720
I was right, huh?

02:03.360 --> 02:05.480
The Emperor complimented you
on your talent.

02:05.560 --> 02:07.360
He wanted you to be a secretariat drafter.

02:08.120 --> 02:09.639
If you want to investigate an old case,

02:09.720 --> 02:11.280
you can leave it to someone you trust.

02:19.720 --> 02:20.600
Ying.

02:22.240 --> 02:23.920
Even if you call me stubborn,

02:25.240 --> 02:26.720
I have to say it.

02:27.560 --> 02:29.000
I must go to Yangzhou.

02:34.760 --> 02:36.160
It's late.

02:37.720 --> 02:38.600
You must be tired.

02:38.680 --> 02:40.480
Rest early.

02:40.560 --> 02:43.120
We'll discuss it later.

02:44.120 --> 02:45.360
I'll walk you out.

02:45.440 --> 02:46.400
No need.

03:26.080 --> 03:29.280
JINRAN

03:36.200 --> 03:37.280
Jinran,

03:38.120 --> 03:40.720
I had to do this.

03:41.480 --> 03:43.080
I collected all the calligraphy,
paintings,

03:43.160 --> 03:45.040
and books in the room.

03:45.120 --> 03:46.440
I'll give them to you.

03:47.040 --> 03:48.320
Please forgive me.

03:54.040 --> 03:55.960
Open the door. Open the door.

03:56.040 --> 03:58.080
Mr. Zhang, Prince Ying asked you

03:58.160 --> 04:00.320
to stay at the mansion

04:00.400 --> 04:01.920
before you agreed
to be the Secretariat Drafter.

04:02.000 --> 04:03.600
Unreasonable.

04:03.680 --> 04:05.760
How dare you! Open the door.

04:05.840 --> 04:07.120
I'm sorry for the offense.

04:45.000 --> 04:46.360
This is Jinran.

04:47.680 --> 04:48.880
I'm a scholar.

04:49.520 --> 04:50.640
I became an official

04:50.720 --> 04:51.960
because of your favor,

04:52.680 --> 04:54.760
but I'm not qualified for this position.

04:54.840 --> 04:56.440
I can't deal
with confidential matters suddenly.

04:57.400 --> 04:59.280
A vassal state paid tribute from far away

04:59.360 --> 05:02.080
because they respected our country.

05:02.680 --> 05:04.840
But they blamed us for some reason
and stopped paying tribute.

05:06.320 --> 05:08.760
Now, we've conquered

05:08.840 --> 05:10.160
the surrounding countries.

05:10.840 --> 05:12.480
I request to go to Yangzhou

05:13.280 --> 05:14.760
to investigate the old case

05:14.840 --> 05:16.320
and find out the truth

05:16.400 --> 05:18.440
to show that we're a prosperous country.

05:22.680 --> 05:24.680
I must send the memorial to His Majesty.

05:26.520 --> 05:27.840
I can't stay in Chang'an.

05:29.320 --> 05:33.640
YANGZHOU

06:27.720 --> 06:31.320
CUI'S MANSION

06:32.720 --> 06:34.280
Father…

06:58.000 --> 06:58.880
Go.

07:07.320 --> 07:08.840
Get away. Don't affect my business.

07:08.920 --> 07:09.840
Get away.

07:50.640 --> 07:52.520
CUI'S MANSION

07:52.600 --> 07:56.360
Let's congratulate Mr. Zheng
on becoming a guild director.

07:56.440 --> 07:58.560
Congratulations, Mr. Zheng.

07:59.160 --> 08:00.600
Thank you for your help.

08:01.120 --> 08:03.480
I appreciate it. Cheers.

08:04.240 --> 08:05.280
-Cheers.
-Cheers.

08:08.840 --> 08:10.480
Mr. Zheng, you're one of the oldest

08:10.560 --> 08:11.720
in the jewelry guild.

08:11.800 --> 08:13.520
You'll become the guild lead

08:13.600 --> 08:16.120
-sooner or later.
-Yeah.

08:16.200 --> 08:19.040
Mr. Zheng, don't forget us then.

08:19.120 --> 08:21.520
-I won't.
-Come on. Here's to you.

08:21.600 --> 08:22.720
Come on.

08:22.800 --> 08:24.360
I'm not dead yet.

08:28.240 --> 08:29.800
-Mr. Cui.
-Mr. Cui.

08:29.880 --> 08:31.240
Mr. Cui.

08:34.880 --> 08:36.080
Mr. Cui.

08:37.559 --> 08:39.480
You're sick.

08:39.559 --> 08:41.240
Why don't you rest at home?

08:41.320 --> 08:43.039
I'm cured.

08:43.120 --> 08:44.920
I should get back to work.

08:45.000 --> 08:46.200
If some bad men get into the guild

08:46.280 --> 08:48.200
while I'm gone,

08:48.280 --> 08:49.960
the reputation of the jewelry guild
will be ruined.

08:51.360 --> 08:52.280
Reputation?

08:53.160 --> 08:55.880
Someone took the tribute pearls.

08:55.960 --> 08:58.800
The reputation of the jewelry guild
has long been ruined.

09:00.400 --> 09:01.280
It's ridiculous.

09:01.800 --> 09:04.640
My Cui family is rich.

09:05.240 --> 09:08.040
Some servants betrayed us.

09:08.120 --> 09:09.760
I've dealt with them.

09:09.840 --> 09:11.080
We accepted the punishment

09:11.680 --> 09:13.120
of the imperial court.

09:13.800 --> 09:15.000
We've paid the compensation.

09:15.880 --> 09:17.000
It's settled.

09:18.680 --> 09:21.640
But the Cui family
is not what it used to be.

09:21.720 --> 09:24.400
The Cui family
is experiencing some difficulties.

09:24.480 --> 09:26.600
As long as the Cui family has its shops,

09:27.960 --> 09:29.440
we'll make a comeback.

09:29.520 --> 09:32.280
You mortgaged your shops and the mansion.

09:32.360 --> 09:33.760
Forget about a comeback.

09:33.840 --> 09:35.680
It's just a temporary mortgage.

09:36.520 --> 09:39.160
The Cui family still has 18 shops.

09:44.600 --> 09:47.440
You are my friends.
You have worked with me for many years.

09:49.080 --> 09:50.400
You don't have to do this.

09:51.280 --> 09:52.680
Give me some time.

09:52.760 --> 09:54.240
I'll prove

09:54.320 --> 09:56.280
that the Cui family's jewelry shop

09:56.360 --> 09:59.200
is one the best in Yangzhou.

10:07.600 --> 10:08.640
We finally arrived in Yangzhou.

10:09.480 --> 10:11.560
Don't you want to rest first?

10:12.200 --> 10:14.080
I don't have time to waste.

10:14.760 --> 10:16.160
Let's deal with the Cui family first.

10:16.240 --> 10:19.280
ETHICAL AND KNOWLEDGEABLE

10:19.360 --> 10:20.280
Master.

10:22.480 --> 10:23.680
You're finally back.

10:24.800 --> 10:25.840
How's the jewelry shop doing?

10:25.920 --> 10:27.560
The Cui family used the mortgage

10:27.640 --> 10:28.880
to pay the damages of the tribute pearls.

10:31.440 --> 10:32.720
Here are the mortgage letters
of the Cui family.

10:32.800 --> 10:34.240
We are the creditors.

10:35.640 --> 10:36.480
Good.

10:37.000 --> 10:38.960
Cui Jingchu is desperate.

10:39.040 --> 10:42.080
Zheng Shiyuan is planning
to take the guild lead from him.

10:43.800 --> 10:44.880
Master.

10:44.960 --> 10:46.280
Here's one more thing.

10:48.560 --> 10:50.800
The new official
of the Governor's Office of Yangzhou

10:50.880 --> 10:54.200
is Xu Nanying,
who just went to Prince Ying.

10:59.720 --> 11:00.640
Noted.

11:05.400 --> 11:06.240
Go.

11:12.920 --> 11:16.080
-Master, please don't leave us alone.
-Master.

11:16.160 --> 11:18.600
He's your own son, Master!

11:19.680 --> 11:21.240
Master!

11:21.320 --> 11:22.640
Stop crying!

11:23.160 --> 11:24.360
I'm not dead yet.

11:24.440 --> 11:26.360
Get out of here!

11:26.440 --> 11:28.160
Someone.

11:28.240 --> 11:29.240
Get them out of here!

11:30.160 --> 11:32.040
-Come on!
-Master!

11:32.120 --> 11:33.000
-No.
-Master

11:33.080 --> 11:35.480
-Master, no.
-Get out!

11:35.560 --> 11:39.160
Master!

11:39.880 --> 11:41.880
Didn't I tell you all to leave?

11:48.760 --> 11:49.720
Yan Zijing.

11:50.320 --> 11:53.080
How dare you come to my place?

11:53.840 --> 11:54.760
Someone.

11:54.840 --> 11:57.520
-Someone!
-Cui Jingchu.

11:58.880 --> 11:59.880
Come on.

12:01.760 --> 12:02.800
Check this out.

12:05.120 --> 12:06.840
My Cui family's shops.

12:18.080 --> 12:20.320
Now, these 18 shops are all mine.

12:20.960 --> 12:22.000
Of course.

12:22.760 --> 12:24.640
Your mansion is also mine.

12:25.680 --> 12:27.960
And I have good news for you.

12:29.760 --> 12:33.280
Not only will Zheng Shiyuan
take your position as the guild lead,

12:33.960 --> 12:35.600
but he will also unite
with guild directors

12:36.160 --> 12:39.360
to kick you out of the jewelry guild.

12:39.440 --> 12:41.920
-How dare they!
-Why?

12:42.440 --> 12:44.640
Your backer has fallen.

12:44.720 --> 12:47.080
You owe a lot of money
because of the tribute pearls.

12:48.120 --> 12:50.160
And your 18 shops are mine.

12:51.040 --> 12:53.760
Your Cui family can't make a comeback.

12:54.880 --> 12:56.880
The Zheng family
will definitely take this opportunity

12:56.960 --> 12:59.600
to hit the Cui family hard.

13:05.920 --> 13:09.440
Have you ever thought about today

13:10.120 --> 13:11.840
when you were killing
the Yangzhou Yan family?

13:18.280 --> 13:19.840
You are the remnant of the Yan family.

13:20.920 --> 13:22.000
Why didn't you die?

13:22.600 --> 13:24.360
Why didn't you die!

13:27.760 --> 13:30.120
Why didn't you die?

13:38.200 --> 13:40.120
Yangzhou Yan's orphan

13:41.160 --> 13:42.840
came to get revenge on you.

13:45.560 --> 13:49.040
Even if I cut you to pieces,
I can't get rid of my hatred.

13:49.840 --> 13:52.960
I've thought of a thousand ways
to kill you.

13:53.880 --> 13:55.560
But I won't kill you today.

13:56.920 --> 13:58.320
I want you to watch

13:58.920 --> 14:01.240
everything in the Cui family

14:02.440 --> 14:03.760
be destroyed.

14:04.920 --> 14:06.880
I will make you repay you a thousand times

14:06.960 --> 14:08.400
for everything you have done
to the Yan family.

14:08.480 --> 14:10.240
I want the Cui family to be destroyed!

14:10.320 --> 14:12.520
I'll make you, Cui Jingchu,
wish you were dead!

14:14.240 --> 14:15.320
Come on.

14:19.800 --> 14:21.200
Don't worry.

14:22.680 --> 14:24.040
I'll make the Zheng family

14:24.960 --> 14:26.600
go down with you together.

15:03.200 --> 15:04.280
Someone…

15:06.400 --> 15:11.480
CUI'S MANSION

15:25.840 --> 15:27.280
Master, it's time…

15:33.760 --> 15:34.760
Master!

15:36.000 --> 15:37.840
Master, why did you hang yourself?

15:38.840 --> 15:40.840
Master. Someone!

15:40.920 --> 15:42.960
Help! The Master hanged himself.

15:43.040 --> 15:44.080
Someone.

15:44.760 --> 15:45.720
Master.

15:48.040 --> 15:52.400
CUI'S MANSION

16:19.600 --> 16:20.760
Mr. Xu,

16:20.840 --> 16:23.680
my Zheng family will rely on you.

16:23.760 --> 16:25.160
Since you say so,

16:25.240 --> 16:27.160
I'll make you drink.

16:27.760 --> 16:31.880
I took office to benefit the people

16:31.960 --> 16:33.280
and Yangzhou,

16:33.360 --> 16:36.880
which is to benefit the Zheng family.

16:37.680 --> 16:40.280
-Yes.
-He just left

16:40.360 --> 16:43.440
and you want to take his place.

16:44.600 --> 16:48.400
I…

16:48.480 --> 16:52.800
I'll drink.

16:54.640 --> 16:57.840
Before I left Chang'an,

16:57.920 --> 17:00.480
Prince Ying told me

17:00.560 --> 17:03.440
that Yangzhou jewelry was famous.

17:03.520 --> 17:06.319
The guild lead
of the Yang Zhou jewelry guild

17:06.400 --> 17:09.200
should be someone capable.

17:11.079 --> 17:12.200
Mr. Zheng,

17:13.200 --> 17:16.800
just do it.

17:22.119 --> 17:23.440
With your words,

17:23.520 --> 17:25.359
I have nothing to worry about.

17:47.320 --> 17:48.320
Father.

17:48.840 --> 17:50.440
I heard

17:50.520 --> 17:52.960
Cui Jingchu
mortgaged his family's property.

17:53.040 --> 17:54.560
I'm afraid the creditor has gone to him.

17:57.160 --> 17:58.560
What a pity!

17:58.640 --> 18:00.520
Mr. Zheng,

18:00.600 --> 18:01.880
that's not what you think, right?

18:08.160 --> 18:09.360
Who are you?

18:09.440 --> 18:11.080
I am the new owner
of the Cui family's property.

18:11.840 --> 18:13.360
I heard that the jewelry guild
is going to have a regular meeting.

18:14.240 --> 18:16.080
So, I came to meet you.

18:18.920 --> 18:20.600
The jewelry guild has rules.

18:21.560 --> 18:23.680
Even if you own the Cui family's property,

18:23.760 --> 18:26.880
you're not qualified to say anything
about the jewelry guild.

18:27.800 --> 18:29.480
Money is nothing to me.

18:30.440 --> 18:32.840
If I use all of Cui's property,

18:32.920 --> 18:36.880
I can become the guild head.

18:38.960 --> 18:40.840
If you want to do it,

18:41.480 --> 18:44.280
you can surprise us
at the jewelry guild's regular meeting.

18:44.360 --> 18:46.320
You don't have to come to me.

18:46.400 --> 18:47.920
Mr. Zheng, you're smart.

18:48.640 --> 18:50.560
I'll get straight to the point.

18:51.240 --> 18:54.480
I want to be a guild director.

18:54.560 --> 18:56.520
You're talking big.

18:57.360 --> 19:00.160
I can't compare to you, Mr. Zheng.

19:00.680 --> 19:01.720
Okay.

19:02.680 --> 19:04.800
Guild director is just a title.

19:04.880 --> 19:07.320
You can't run for the guild lead.

19:08.040 --> 19:09.280
Of course.

19:09.360 --> 19:14.160
Congratulations on getting
what you wanted.

19:16.000 --> 19:16.840
Go.

19:32.680 --> 19:34.680
I don't care who he is.

19:35.600 --> 19:39.000
Yangzhou is my territory.

19:40.640 --> 19:42.960
-What does it say?
-Who can read?

19:43.040 --> 19:44.440
Read it to us.

19:44.520 --> 19:45.360
Let me.

19:46.640 --> 19:47.640
"Xu Nanying,

19:47.720 --> 19:50.320
the official of the Governor's Office
of Yangzhou, warns you.

19:50.400 --> 19:52.320
Abide by ethics,

19:52.400 --> 19:54.200
abide by the law.

19:54.280 --> 19:55.960
The Emperor rules the world

19:56.040 --> 19:57.840
with strict laws.

19:57.920 --> 19:59.480
People who enter the city

19:59.560 --> 20:00.760
shall be investigated,

20:00.840 --> 20:02.360
in case they are bad people.

20:02.960 --> 20:04.600
Sick people are not allowed

20:04.680 --> 20:06.120
to enter the city."

20:07.840 --> 20:09.080
Xu Nanying…

20:09.960 --> 20:11.440
I didn't expect him to come to Yangzhou.

20:15.960 --> 20:17.120
It's strict.

20:17.720 --> 20:18.840
It will not be easy to enter the city.

20:20.280 --> 20:21.360
Give me.

20:23.720 --> 20:24.760
Do you want more?

20:28.200 --> 20:29.400
A pretty girl.

20:35.600 --> 20:36.480
Miss.

20:38.360 --> 20:40.200
-Get away!
-Look at your injuries.

20:40.280 --> 20:41.840
You must have suffered a lot.

20:41.920 --> 20:42.960
If you are my wife,

20:43.040 --> 20:44.960
you will be happy.

20:45.040 --> 20:46.000
Do you think you are qualified?

20:46.080 --> 20:47.320
I'm from the Cui family.

20:47.400 --> 20:48.680
The Cui family is destroyed.

20:48.760 --> 20:49.880
Cui Jingchu is dead.

20:49.960 --> 20:52.240
-No way!
-Don't you believe me?

20:52.320 --> 20:53.920
Today is his funeral.

20:54.640 --> 20:57.320
-Funeral?
-Are you really a Cui?

21:03.760 --> 21:06.080
Come on. Chase her!

21:08.600 --> 21:11.360
It's time.

21:12.600 --> 21:15.560
Lift it up.

21:16.720 --> 21:18.520
Throw money.

21:20.240 --> 21:22.040
CUI JINGCHU'S MEMORIAL TABLET

21:31.880 --> 21:32.960
Duanwu.

21:33.640 --> 21:35.600
It's Mr. Cui of the Zhenlang Pavilion.

21:37.040 --> 21:38.440
How come?

21:45.840 --> 21:50.400
Father!

21:52.240 --> 21:54.160
Father!

21:57.040 --> 21:58.560
Crazy woman, stop screaming.

21:58.640 --> 22:00.640
It's the Cui family!

22:01.160 --> 22:02.040
Go!

22:18.040 --> 22:18.960
Out of the way.

22:19.480 --> 22:20.480
Beggar.

22:25.800 --> 22:27.680
I'll kill you!

22:30.240 --> 22:31.480
Be good.

23:12.960 --> 23:13.920
Yunxiu.

23:14.440 --> 23:16.480
-Yunxiu.
-Duanwu.

23:16.560 --> 23:17.680
Sit down.

23:18.400 --> 23:20.440
-Are you okay?
-I'm fine. Don't worry.

23:27.120 --> 23:28.480
Why did you save me?

23:33.400 --> 23:34.440
You saved the slaves

23:36.720 --> 23:37.680
in the mine.

23:39.560 --> 23:40.560
We're even.

23:42.120 --> 23:43.280
Forget it.

23:47.160 --> 23:48.640
I'll pay you back.

23:53.800 --> 23:54.960
Duanwu.

23:55.040 --> 23:56.720
Why would we save her?

24:03.760 --> 24:04.720
Let's go.

24:50.760 --> 24:53.560
Duanwu. The Jubao House

24:53.640 --> 24:54.800
has a lot of expensive jewelry.

24:54.880 --> 24:56.640
They have the best glassware.

24:58.440 --> 24:59.840
The jewelry of Zheng's Jubao House

25:00.680 --> 25:01.920
is the best in Yangzhou.

25:03.760 --> 25:05.640
We'll go to a lot of jewelry shops today.

25:05.720 --> 25:06.640
Okay.

25:08.080 --> 25:09.120
Duanwu, look.

25:11.120 --> 25:12.040
Who is that?

25:12.120 --> 25:14.520
-Lady Bai is beautiful.
-Yeah.

25:15.120 --> 25:16.880
-Lady Bai becomes more beautiful.
-Yeah.

25:18.760 --> 25:20.040
She's so beautiful.

25:20.760 --> 25:21.840
Lady Bai is beautiful.

25:21.920 --> 25:24.120
-Lady Bai.
-Lady Bai.

25:31.000 --> 25:33.160
Did you see the necklace
Lady Bai was wearing?

25:34.600 --> 25:37.480
The style is beautiful.

25:37.560 --> 25:39.440
Lady Bai!

25:39.520 --> 25:41.440
Her head jewelry is beautiful.

25:41.520 --> 25:43.720
Her golden hairpins are beautiful.

25:45.400 --> 25:46.240
Duanwu.

25:46.320 --> 25:48.680
Her necklace and head jewelry are normal.

25:48.760 --> 25:50.600
The styles are old.

25:50.680 --> 25:51.760
What do you know?

25:51.840 --> 25:53.600
Lady Bai's makeup and clothing fits
are popular in Yangzhou.

25:53.680 --> 25:55.400
Women imitate her.

25:56.560 --> 25:58.440
-It's beautiful.
-Miss.

25:59.640 --> 26:01.680
We've just arrived in Yangzhou.

26:01.760 --> 26:04.120
Is she the most beautiful woman
in Yangzhou?

26:04.200 --> 26:05.320
Yes.

26:05.400 --> 26:08.440
Where did she get her jewelry?

26:08.520 --> 26:09.640
They are from Baicaojing House.

26:09.720 --> 26:11.600
Lady Bai only wears jewelry
from Baicaojing House.

26:14.240 --> 26:15.320
Baicaojing House?

26:16.800 --> 26:20.160
Is it owned by Lady Bai?

26:20.240 --> 26:21.640
No, it's not.

26:21.720 --> 26:25.200
Baicaojing House became popular
because of Lady Bai.

26:26.160 --> 26:28.560
Lady Bai is beautiful.

26:28.640 --> 26:30.960
-Maybe she can be the second Lady Yu.
-Mm.

26:31.040 --> 26:32.520
-Let's go.
-Wait.

26:32.600 --> 26:34.920
Who is Lady Yu?

26:35.920 --> 26:36.840
Lady Yu

26:36.920 --> 26:39.360
was the most popular and beautiful woman
in Yangzhou 20 years ago.

26:39.960 --> 26:41.520
Why don't you know anything?

26:41.600 --> 26:42.640
You're not locals, right?

26:43.600 --> 26:45.000
Yeah, we're not locals.

26:45.080 --> 26:46.320
We're curious about Yangzhou.

26:46.400 --> 26:49.360
Could you tell us
about the most beautiful woman?

26:49.440 --> 26:51.520
At the Qionghua Festival three years ago,

26:51.600 --> 26:53.160
Lady Bai won the contest
for the first time.

26:53.240 --> 26:56.080
She made Baicaojing House
from mediocre to famous.

26:56.160 --> 26:57.800
-Got it?
-Oh…

26:57.880 --> 26:58.920
Is there anything else?

26:59.000 --> 27:01.080
If nothing else, we'll leave.

27:01.160 --> 27:02.680
-Thank you.
-Thank you.

27:03.640 --> 27:05.400
Let's go to Baicaojing House.

27:05.480 --> 27:06.520
Okay.

27:10.640 --> 27:11.600
Yunxiu.

27:12.120 --> 27:13.280
It seems that the jewelry itself
is not important

27:14.040 --> 27:15.880
in Yangzhou.

27:16.600 --> 27:18.040
What matters is the person
who wears the jewelry.

27:19.360 --> 27:20.840
The most beautiful woman in Yangzhou…

27:35.640 --> 27:37.280
Here comes the imperial edict.

27:41.320 --> 27:45.640
Zhang Jinran, the chancellor
of the Institute of Literary Studies.

27:48.480 --> 27:51.800
Zhang Jinran, the chancellor
of the Institute of Literary Studies.

27:52.400 --> 27:55.280
You're calm and ethical.

27:55.360 --> 27:57.680
You're a fair man and an official.

27:57.760 --> 28:01.120
You're praised for your fairness.

28:01.200 --> 28:03.320
I'll make you the Inspector of Huainandao

28:03.920 --> 28:06.880
to investigate the case
and pacify the people.

28:06.960 --> 28:08.040
Take the imperial edict.

28:08.920 --> 28:12.120
I, Zhang Jinran, thank the Emperor.

28:20.240 --> 28:21.760
IMPERIAL EDICT

28:28.640 --> 28:30.880
Jinran, you…

28:32.640 --> 28:33.680
Ying.

28:35.160 --> 28:37.960
I won't forget you taking care of me.

28:38.480 --> 28:40.440
Before returning to Chang'an,

28:40.520 --> 28:42.880
I sent a request to the Emperor.

28:43.480 --> 28:45.160
I came back to take a break

28:45.240 --> 28:46.680
and wait for the appointment.

28:47.360 --> 28:49.000
That being the case,

28:51.080 --> 28:52.720
I can't stop you.

28:58.800 --> 29:00.840
You have an important mission

29:00.920 --> 29:02.320
in Yangzhou.

29:03.160 --> 29:05.120
If you need people or money,

29:06.000 --> 29:07.120
you can go to the Zheng family.

29:07.880 --> 29:10.040
They have been running a jewelry shop
for many years.

29:10.760 --> 29:13.800
They are the model
of righteous businessmen.

29:15.400 --> 29:18.080
I'll keep that in mind.

29:18.160 --> 29:20.160
How are you going to Yangzhou?

29:21.160 --> 29:22.480
I'm going to go there by water.

29:23.880 --> 29:25.360
It's good.

29:26.880 --> 29:28.320
It's tiring by land.

29:29.160 --> 29:30.200
Take care.

29:38.760 --> 29:39.720
Take care.

30:00.480 --> 30:02.400
If I hadn't sneaked
into Prince Ying's Mansion

30:02.480 --> 30:04.360
and sent your letter to the Emperor,

30:04.440 --> 30:06.320
I don't know how long
you would have stayed here.

30:06.960 --> 30:08.760
I have

30:08.840 --> 30:10.040
to let Ying down.

30:11.120 --> 30:11.960
Well.

30:12.920 --> 30:14.360
How are things out there?

30:14.440 --> 30:16.400
Our people followed the clues
all the way to Bianzhou.

30:16.480 --> 30:18.400
We found a suspicious cargo ship.

30:18.480 --> 30:19.480
It's said that the ship
was filled with spices.

30:19.560 --> 30:20.720
But it drafted deep.

30:20.800 --> 30:23.240
It stayed in port for months
but didn't trade.

30:23.320 --> 30:24.440
And it was well-guarded.

30:24.520 --> 30:26.040
It left suddenly the night before last.

30:27.320 --> 30:29.240
-Where did it go?
-It went south along the Bian River.

30:29.320 --> 30:30.160
It should have gone to Yangzhou.

30:31.320 --> 30:32.680
Yangzhou.

30:33.680 --> 30:35.960
Did you find all the files
on the desert bandit robberies?

30:36.040 --> 30:37.720
Yes. There are two carriages of files.

30:37.800 --> 30:39.760
Okay. Let's go to Yangzhou now.

30:39.840 --> 30:40.920
Mr. Zhang.

30:41.440 --> 30:43.120
On our way back to Chang'an,

30:43.880 --> 30:45.800
someone became the official
of the Governor's Office.

30:51.640 --> 30:52.480
Xu Nanying?

30:53.400 --> 30:55.440
He returned to the capital with guilt
but was promoted.

31:01.800 --> 31:02.640
Let's go.

31:07.800 --> 31:09.480
ZHENLANG PAVILION

31:11.720 --> 31:14.920
Duanwu. That's the Zhenlang Pavilion.
It's magnificent.

31:15.000 --> 31:16.720
Let's go in and have a look.

31:16.800 --> 31:20.400
I heard that the Zhenlang Pavilion…

31:20.480 --> 31:21.560
Take care.

31:22.280 --> 31:23.760
Is Mr. Yan here?

31:24.280 --> 31:25.120
He's out.

31:25.200 --> 31:26.240
He'll be back in a minute.

31:26.320 --> 31:28.440
-Sir. Please go in.
-Okay.

31:40.280 --> 31:44.080
ZHENLANG PAVILION

31:47.480 --> 31:48.560
Father.

31:49.200 --> 31:51.240
I'll take the Zhenlang Pavilion back.

32:03.280 --> 32:04.320
Yan Zijing!

32:46.080 --> 32:47.880
Many people died at the Langhuan Dockyard.

32:51.680 --> 32:53.520
But you're hiding in Yangzhou.

32:57.040 --> 32:58.080
Yeah.

33:00.000 --> 33:01.120
They're all dead.

33:12.960 --> 33:14.200
The witch doctor is dead.

33:15.040 --> 33:16.080
I don't have long to live.

33:17.040 --> 33:19.400
-I can't see her.
-Tell Duanwu the truth.

33:21.240 --> 33:23.320
Otherwise, she'll hate you.

33:23.400 --> 33:24.720
Let her hate me.

33:26.200 --> 33:27.680
She'll be safe that way.

33:31.760 --> 33:33.320
You didn't think I'd survive.

33:36.200 --> 33:38.480
You didn't think I'd see you again.

33:41.040 --> 33:42.560
The truth is what you saw.

33:44.120 --> 33:45.680
The truth is what I saw?

33:59.000 --> 34:00.640
You tried to kill me?

34:04.840 --> 34:05.680
Whatever.

34:10.000 --> 34:10.840
Let go!

34:12.760 --> 34:14.120
Turn around.

34:15.560 --> 34:17.320
Turn around!

34:18.920 --> 34:21.080
Turn around and look at me!

34:24.440 --> 34:25.679
I taught you

34:26.480 --> 34:27.679
all your kung fu

34:28.360 --> 34:29.440
and business.

34:31.239 --> 34:33.080
I'll teach you one last thing.

34:40.040 --> 34:41.000
You.

34:43.280 --> 34:44.840
Get out of Yangzhou.

34:47.560 --> 34:49.239
Stay away from me.

35:09.320 --> 35:10.400
Go.

35:16.920 --> 35:18.000
Duanwu.

35:18.520 --> 35:21.000
You finally got to see what he really is.

35:49.240 --> 35:52.800
Duanwu, what's wrong? Duanwu.

36:00.840 --> 36:03.960
ZHENLANG PAVILION

36:07.160 --> 36:08.880
I saw Yan Zijing.

36:13.760 --> 36:15.680
He asked me to leave Yangzhou.

36:20.680 --> 36:24.080
Duanwu. Duanwu.

36:24.760 --> 36:26.920
Let's leave Yangzhou.

36:27.000 --> 36:28.480
Let's get out of here.

36:28.560 --> 36:31.440
I'm there for you.

36:31.520 --> 36:34.000
I'll be with you wherever you go.

36:41.200 --> 36:43.200
ZHENLANG PAVILION

36:46.760 --> 36:48.320
We shouldn't leave.

36:56.320 --> 36:57.160
Yunxiu.

36:58.160 --> 36:59.880
We must stay in Yangzhou.

37:03.360 --> 37:04.880
I have to let him know

37:07.480 --> 37:09.640
that I can live well

37:11.200 --> 37:13.400
without him.

37:23.000 --> 37:24.360
We must open a shop.

37:26.240 --> 37:27.440
Open a shop?

37:30.440 --> 37:31.560
Okay, Duanwu.

37:32.520 --> 37:33.840
We'll stay in Yangzhou.

37:34.840 --> 37:35.760
Duanwu.

37:36.280 --> 37:37.760
Don't be sad.

37:45.880 --> 37:47.880
Baicaojing House made a woman popular.

37:51.960 --> 37:53.720
We can also give it a try.

38:08.880 --> 38:12.160
Duanwu. Duanwu,
what's wrong with you? Duanwu.

38:12.240 --> 38:15.080
Help!

38:15.160 --> 38:18.720
Duanwu.

38:20.040 --> 38:22.640
Help!

38:26.280 --> 38:29.200
YUNSHENG INN, ROAST PORK

38:34.240 --> 38:35.360
Daunwu, you're back.

38:44.440 --> 38:45.560
Have some tea.

38:49.880 --> 38:51.040
After a long journey,

38:54.240 --> 38:55.840
we still have to ask
the Zheng family for help.

38:57.520 --> 38:58.880
I asked around.

38:58.960 --> 39:00.040
Ms. Yu

39:00.920 --> 39:03.040
is Zheng Zhiheng's mother.

39:04.480 --> 39:06.080
At the Qionghua Festival three years ago,

39:06.160 --> 39:07.280
Bai Niao won the contest.

39:07.360 --> 39:09.160
Then, she won twice in a row.

39:09.680 --> 39:11.040
She made the Baicaojing House famous

39:11.120 --> 39:13.320
on her own.

39:15.520 --> 39:16.880
I wonder…

39:20.560 --> 39:22.440
If we could make a girl popular

39:23.560 --> 39:24.400
like Baicaojing House,

39:25.160 --> 39:26.520
then, we'll open a shop.

39:26.600 --> 39:29.280
What does this have to do with Lady Yu?

39:29.360 --> 39:30.600
She was the most beautiful
and popular woman

39:30.680 --> 39:31.960
in Yangzhou 20 years ago.

39:32.040 --> 39:34.520
Can she influence the beauty contest?

39:35.120 --> 39:37.000
She is a concubine of the Zheng family.

39:37.960 --> 39:40.920
She's welcomed by all the shops.

39:41.000 --> 39:43.320
Everyone in the Baicaojing House

39:43.400 --> 39:44.720
respects her,

39:44.800 --> 39:46.600
including Bai Niao.

39:47.800 --> 39:49.240
What do you think?

40:06.760 --> 40:08.680
Maybe this shell

40:12.880 --> 40:14.280
can help us.

40:15.360 --> 40:16.800
-This one.
-Yes.

40:16.880 --> 40:19.800
Umbrella.

40:19.880 --> 40:21.120
Buy some cabbage.

40:21.200 --> 40:22.600
Take a look.

40:22.680 --> 40:25.080
Look at the umbrella. Umbrella.

40:25.160 --> 40:26.880
Miss, these are newly arrived hairpins.

40:26.960 --> 40:29.520
-Umbrella.
-These.

40:29.600 --> 40:31.240
This pink one is beautiful.

40:31.760 --> 40:33.680
-How much is this?
-Five hundred cash.

40:35.200 --> 40:36.600
Five hundred cash?

40:36.680 --> 40:37.760
Is one enough?

40:37.840 --> 40:39.560
-Fifty cash for one flower, right?
-Yes.

40:39.640 --> 40:40.840
-Okay.
-I want a pink flower.

40:40.920 --> 40:42.000
Okay.

40:46.040 --> 40:47.600
Do you need anything else?

40:47.680 --> 40:49.000
-That, and that.
-Okay.

40:49.080 --> 40:50.400
This pink flower is the most beautiful.

40:52.440 --> 40:53.520
Here's your money.

40:53.600 --> 40:55.000
-How much is it?
-Six cash.

40:55.080 --> 40:56.160
-I will come again.
-Thank you.

40:56.240 --> 40:57.560
Miss, take care.

40:58.360 --> 40:59.600
Vegetables.

41:00.120 --> 41:01.480
Miss, have a look at the hairpins.

41:01.560 --> 41:03.160
Fresh vegetables.

41:04.240 --> 41:05.760
She likes pink.

41:05.840 --> 41:07.680
She can't bear to buy expensive jewelry.

41:11.200 --> 41:13.080
Shell inlay hairpins.

41:13.160 --> 41:14.720
Shell inlay bracelets.

41:14.800 --> 41:16.480
Shell inlay necklaces.

41:17.560 --> 41:20.320
One thousand cash for three pieces.

41:20.400 --> 41:21.360
Have a look.

41:21.440 --> 41:23.840
-Yunxiu.
-Those snobs.

41:23.920 --> 41:26.280
They couldn't fix a broken jade bracelet.

41:26.360 --> 41:27.480
Come on.

41:27.560 --> 41:29.720
Miss, I can fix it.

41:29.800 --> 41:31.720
Can I see your broken jade bracelet?

41:32.320 --> 41:34.080
It's the Zheng's place.

41:34.160 --> 41:35.800
Who are you to set up a stall here?

41:36.400 --> 41:37.400
Drive them away.

41:37.480 --> 41:38.400
Miss.

41:38.480 --> 41:40.720
We have the latest shell inlay hairpins
and earrings.

41:40.800 --> 41:42.080
Would you like to have a look?

41:42.160 --> 41:43.400
Get out of here!

41:43.480 --> 41:45.440
Okay, we'll leave.

41:46.840 --> 41:48.280
-Just leave!
-Okay.

41:56.360 --> 41:57.440
I'm sorry.

41:57.520 --> 41:58.960
Go help her.

42:04.680 --> 42:06.720
Look at this. It's beautiful.

42:07.880 --> 42:10.480
What are you whispering about?
Give it to me.

42:17.560 --> 42:18.560
It's beautiful.

42:22.280 --> 42:23.360
Here you go.

42:34.000 --> 42:36.360
Miss, you're beautiful.

42:36.440 --> 42:37.440
This ordinary earring

42:37.520 --> 42:39.200
Ordinary earrings
can't flatter your beauty.

42:42.960 --> 42:44.520
Your skin is fair.

42:44.600 --> 42:46.920
The pink shell suits you well.

42:47.000 --> 42:48.040
Stop it.

42:48.640 --> 42:51.600
You said you could fix jewelry.

42:52.280 --> 42:55.080
I have a broken jade bracelet.

42:55.160 --> 42:56.400
Can you fix it?

42:57.600 --> 42:58.800
Can we have a look?

42:59.560 --> 43:00.760
Be careful.

43:00.840 --> 43:02.880
It's Lady Yu's most precious thing.
